{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight foes with fun action combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/4dfadb030906890afb7c1c4e8ad98c2a.poster.avif?t=1768496282\" width=332 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/4dfadb030906890afb7c1c4e8ad98c2a.webm?t=1768496282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/4dfadb030906890afb7c1c4e8ad98c2a.mp4?t=1768496282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your enemies with not only your sword and shield, but the tools you find and items from the environment. Position yourself wisely and attack at the right moment to catch enemies off guard. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore dungeons to grow your toolkit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/3b2fb53332a8432c1ed2b45200ce970a.poster.avif?t=1768496282\" width=332 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/3b2fb53332a8432c1ed2b45200ce970a.webm?t=1768496282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/3b2fb53332a8432c1ed2b45200ce970a.mp4?t=1768496282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5 themed dungeons on a hand-built map. Solve puzzles along the way to find keys to any locked doors. Discover the items each dungeon hides and defeat the boss. Use what you find to gain access to new secrets and areas of the map. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rise from the grave and expel the evil curse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/11e319e79d435a34f407d687633882a2.poster.avif?t=1768496282\" width=332 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/11e319e79d435a34f407d687633882a2.webm?t=1768496282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/extras/11e319e79d435a34f407d687633882a2.mp4?t=1768496282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tethria is a land cursed to bear an evil king's return. When this Cursed King returns a divine hero always rises to push him back. In the current age the Cursed King's army has gathered outside Tethria's gates, but no hero has appeared to challenge him. The brave soldiers of Tethria steel themselves, but their defeat is inevitable. Can a champion rise from the ashes and gain the power needed to defeat the Cursed King?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726380?t=1768496282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/fe758defb239c93b848f6785970e2ea4afd91230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768496282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/904d42c7f147569a9065a448711308684e494b56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768496282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726380/904d42c7f147569a9065a448711308684e494b56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768496282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","i